# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# THE RETRIEVAL CACHE — never committed. This is a rule, not a preference.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Cached wikitext is required locally: it makes claims re-checkable without new
# requests, and it means work survives if Lexicanum hardens against us mid-project.
# But this repository is PUBLIC, and committing bulk wikitext would republish
# Lexicanum's own expression — which PROMPT.md §5 forbids. Only the source METADATA
# in data/sources.yaml is committed. See frame/schema.md §8.
sources/raw/
sources/tmp/

# Generated site input and output. build/docs is regenerated by frame/build.mjs on
# every run; editing it by hand accomplishes nothing.
build/
site/

# Toolchain
node_modules/
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Machine-local agent settings — not for a public repo
.claude/settings.local.json

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
